  "html": "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:502px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Logan_the_liger.jpg\" title=\"Logan the Liger's camp on Purpose-Pondering Peak\"><img alt=\"Logan the Liger's camp on Purpose-Pondering Peak\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"272\" src=\"/images/Logan_the_liger.jpg\" width=\"500\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Logan_the_liger.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Logan the Liger's camp on Purpose-Pondering Peak</div></div></div></div>\n<p>Logan the Liger is a former mentor to wrestlers who has left the busy ringside life and is now camped at the very top of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Purpose-Pondering Peak</a>.  It is a long and convoluted climb to get there.  He is the Object of the Quest <a href=\"/wiki/Track_Down_Logan_the_Liger\" title=\"Track Down Logan the Liger\">Track Down Logan the Liger</a> and a Quest giver.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Logan_the_Liger.27s_Quests\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Logan the Liger's Quests</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Purpose_Pondering_Peak\" title=\"Purpose Pondering Peak\">Purpose Pondering Peak</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Report_to_Commissioner_Dumas\" title=\"Report to Commissioner Dumas\">Report to Commissioner Dumas</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Eye_of_the_Liger\" title=\"Eye of the Liger\">Eye of the Liger</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Other_Eye_of_the_Liger\" title=\"Other Eye of the Liger\">Other Eye of the Liger</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
